==Description==
The '''Korblox Guard''' was an enemy that only appeared in [[Huevous Hunt]] as part of [[The Hunt Event]]. It had higher health and faster speed than the [[Korblox Seeker (The Hunt)|Korblox Seeker]], though it gave less cash upon death. In easy mode, it had no immunities, though in hard mode on some waves it could have the [[Stun Immunity]], [[Freeze Immunity]] or be hidden.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Guard''' had blue skin. It wore a black shirt and pants, a blue helmet with grey outlines and blue neon spikes, and a red belt with a grey buckle. It wore an arm-pad and a knee-pad on its right arm and leg. There were also blue neon spikes on its right arm and leg. It did not have a left arm and leg, exposing its skeleton.

==Strategy==
*The [[Pyromancer]] and [[Golden Pyromancer]] can be quite effective at clearing out hordes of '''Korblox Guard''' early on.
**However, due to its high health on Hard mode, a horde of '''Korblox Guards''' may leak through.
*The [[Shotgunner]], ideally in pairs of two, can be effective against the '''Korblox Guard'''.
*Later on, the [[Minigunner]] and [[Accelerator]] can easily clear out hordes of these.
**They are also useful as they have both hidden detection, making them able to deal damage to the '''Korblox Guard''' on all waves.

